Single PostgreSQL database migrations for Freight Event Intelligence Platform.

Run from the repository root with the development environment active:
  task db-current
  task db-history
  task db-migrate
  task db-revision -- "description"

DATABASE_URL is required and loaded through app.infra.config, including .env.
alembic/env.py imports ORM models to populate Base.metadata for autogeneration.
Review generated upgrades and downgrades before applying them.

Current revision chain:
  34fe2111c108: shipments and shipment_events
  6f8e4c7a1b2d: shipment location fields
  8b7c3d2e1f0a: lifecycle timestamp and event processing status

task db-rollback downgrades one revision and changes database state.
Integration fixtures apply migrations to the isolated freight_events_test
database. Follow README.md for test URL setup; never use the development
database for integration fixtures that clean tables.
